flowchart LR
  accTitle: A turn goes from the client through the Worker to the session object, which journals in its SQLite and is restarted by an alarm after a reset
  client[/Client/] --> worker[Worker]
  worker --> object[Session object]
  object -->|journal| storage[(Object SQLite)]
  object -->|model requests| gateway[AI Gateway]
  object -. alarm after a reset .-> next[Next instance]
  next --> storage
